      "en": "Tuned from Dexter Young live values. The deadband is narrowed to 4 percentage points so the target settles closer to the middle, and follow is raised to 1.2 deg / velocity 180 / 0.04 s. Plan-based runaway suspicion is not real measured joint travel, so it warns instead of blocking.",
